// endpoint_report_vendor_spend.proto — ReportVendorSpend. DIAGNOSTICS section.
//
// EMACS REPORTS THE VENDOR CALLS IT MAKES ITSELF. Every other vendor call is
// counted where it is made: a session's by its shim (shim.v1.ShimMeasurements
// vendor_spend), the daemon's headless questions by the daemon's one headless
// exec site. Emacs's headless prompt summaries are made by Emacs, so Emacs
// reads each run's usage and reports it here, and the daemon folds it into
// the same spend series (skills/agent-repl-metrics/CATALOG.md,
// `agentrepl_vendor_*`).
//
// A REPORT IS ONE RUN'S CALLS, SENT ONCE. A report lost to a daemon restart
// is lost: the run's figures are not kept for a retry, because a spend
// series that could count a run twice is worse than one that misses one.

